// Integer-seeded Python Random compatibility; no heap or OS dependency.
// Sources: CPython v3.14.3 Modules/_randommodule.c and Lib/random.py.
// State and input/output/scratch buffers must be live and nonoverlapping.
// Initialize before use. Non-cryptographic, for reproducible experiments.
// Direct bits/below helpers have documented valid domains; checked wrappers
// return -70 invalid argument / -71 capacity without consuming random state.
